f3c9ecb5.mp3", "buttery|Do you want to meet today or tomorrow?": "dec199cbcc60.mp3", "airy|Yes, I do.": "f3ba21cedc19.mp3", "airy|Tomorrow works better for me.": "1bd12623df27.mp3", "airy|At the meeting.": "6d055568baf6.mp3", "buttery|Whose laptop is this?": "57bbc4154d40.mp3", "airy|It's on the table.": "2b0c1b53892a.mp3", "airy|A new model.": "1c98e58f4920.mp3", "airy|I think it's Mr. Kim's.": "fc5de6f4768a.mp3", "buttery|The elevator is out of order, isn't it?": "e5524fca16f6.mp3", "airy|Yes, we have to use the stairs.": "ebf9a9866558.mp3", "airy|I ordered it yesterday.": "23b6df7f98eb.mp3", "airy|On the fifth floor.": "13cf532344a6.mp3", "buttery|How much does the annual membership cost?": "bc8a453a1ddd.mp3", "airy|Once a year.": "82e360346098.mp3", "airy|Sixty dollars.": "c8f4dd6b498f.mp3", "airy|At the front desk.": "74eb6466e479.mp3", "buttery|Why don't we take a short break?": "125e8a1949ec.mp3", "airy|Because it's broken.": "08a6ceb2c866.mp3", "airy|It took an hour.": "b69063463fc6.mp3", "airy|That's a good idea.": "d003a9e802ad.mp3", "buttery|Which bus goes to the city center?": "c88e412b743c.mp3", "airy|Number twelve.": "262f965f7c7d.mp3", "airy|Every ten minutes.": "00bdb9ce5397.mp3", "airy|It's very crowded.": "9be28ceb5e05.mp3", "buttery|When is the deadline for the budget report?": "1962584b7ffc.mp3", "airy|In the finance office.": "b903ddd97f1d.mp3", "airy|The end of this month.": "a677d1d62074.mp3", "airy|Mr. Chen wrote it.": "cafc8b4733b2.mp3", "buttery|Can you help me move these boxes?": "6f2af2a4c571.mp3", "airy|A moving company.": "e5dea881f8cf.mp3", "airy|They're cardboard.": "e2ea3e14983e.mp3", "airy|Sure, where should I put them?": "85cbb0d97d74.mp3", "buttery|Who should I contact about the invoice?": "d50565d19ec5.mp3", "airy|Try the accounting department.": "43954b63da04.mp3", "airy|By e-mail.": "7ba49cd195d8.mp3", "airy|It's fifty dollars.": "0937696bd47a.mp3", "buttery|Didn't you attend the workshop last week?": "9d40c6fa62fd.mp3", "airy|It lasts two hours.": "4c98087b581b.mp3", "airy|No, I was on a business trip.": "fafcea4efdd5.mp3", "airy|The shop is closed.": "f60d626f4361.mp3", "buttery|How often do you back up your files?": "28dd5a4a3581.mp3", "airy|On the back shelf.": "e344233d200c.mp3", "airy|A large folder.": "c7a68e3e6834.mp3", "airy|At least once a week.": "58bd4a901c2f.mp3", "buttery|Where can I find the visitor parking area?": "82615ff7035d.mp3", "airy|It's behind the main building.": "77e93fec15f2.mp3", "airy|For two hours.": "4814f6819910.mp3", "airy|I parked there yesterday.": "674c2721e45d.mp3", "buttery|Would you mind closing the window?": "b90ebcd5efdb.mp3", "airy|A closing sale.": "a15f2550fded.mp3", "airy|Not at all.": "d03821a70d53.mp3", "airy|Near the door.": "44fd6f426ea5.mp3", "buttery|What time does the pharmacy open?": "5b08dfe1fe1b.mp3", "airy|On Main Street.": "6002c0c068c8.mp3", "airy|Some medicine.": "fb8919d3c782.mp3", "airy|At nine A.M.": "76ae7c7fe70b.mp3", "buttery|I can't find my employee badge.": "a985d06b3b12.mp3", "airy|Have you checked your desk drawer?": "ff34d8e4d72b.mp3", "airy|It's a nice badge.": "de40155e86c9.mp3", "airy|Yes, I found one.": "ded29a18e681.mp3", "buttery|Should I book a hotel room for the conference?": "d72b0a01f2a7.mp3", "airy|A double room.": "a814cfc9c610.mp3", "airy|Yes, please reserve one for two nights.": "b9bf8b66eaef.mp3", "airy|The book is on the shelf.": "96e35a98da18.mp3", "buttery|How was your presentation this morning?": "90ead881b9fc.mp3", "airy|At ten o'clock.": "29ec9d9dfa53.mp3", "airy|In the main hall.": "59c2bbe98192.mp3", "airy|It went really well, thanks.": "aa990718b7d1.mp3", "airy|Hi, Mark. Have you finished the sales report for the Singapore office?": "6ef56af8b32a.mp3", "rounded|Almost. I'm still waiting for the figures from the accounting department.": "2923195a2864.mp3", "airy|The meeting is at three o'clock. Could you call them and ask them to hurry?": "7710db16d1f0.mp3", "rounded|Sure, I'll call them right now.": "d8c5964b30da.mp3", "airy|Excuse me, I bought this blender here last week, but it stopped working yesterday.": "39cd1b19e2bd.mp3", "rounded|I'm sorry to hear that. Do you have your receipt?": "2c742c84a80a.mp3", "airy|Yes, here it is. Could I exchange it for a new one?": "dcf71f775095.mp3", "rounded|Of course. Let me get one from the stockroom.": "dde51c553c0b.mp3", "rounded|Hi, I'd like to reserve a table for six people this Friday at seven.": "79b71763c21a.mp3", "airy|I'm sorry, we're fully booked at seven. We have a table at eight thirty.": "a752430acd60.mp3", "rounded|That's a little late, but it's fine. It's for my colleague's retirement party.": "3a9733536479.mp3", "airy|Great. May I have your name, please?": "e15cc546986a.mp3", "airy|Tom, the projector in room three isn't working, and my presentation starts in twenty minutes.": "752ad0b2729a.mp3", "rounded|Have you tried restarting it?": "225c9ec64429.mp3", "airy|Twice. It still shows a blank screen.": "b6d9a8c2998d.mp3", "rounded|Then use room five instead. I'll let the attendees know about the change.": "e0cfc61897dd.mp3", "rounded|Good morning. I have an appointment with Doctor Patel at ten.": "5b70b60f67a6.mp3", "airy|Good morning. Could you fill out this form while you wait? The doctor is running about fifteen minutes late.": "e67e1a4c2777.mp3", "rounded|No problem. Is there a place where I can get some water?": "9d1ada44bbf5.mp3", "airy|There's a water cooler just around the corner.": "ef890a41c5da.mp3", "airy|Did you hear that the company is opening a new branch in Osaka?": "a55b2c0d2cf6.mp3", "rounded|Yes, I heard they need a manager for it. Are you going to apply?": "a958341bc361.mp3", "airy|I'm thinking about it. The application deadline is next Friday.": "10d67cee1fbd.mp3", "rounded|You should. You have more experience than anyone on the team.": "ee257fa4544a.mp3", "rounded|Hello, I'm calling about the apartment listed on your website. Is it still available?": "5f7baeea84c3.mp3", "airy|Yes, it is. It has two bedrooms, and it's a five-minute walk from the subway.": "398b0397789e.mp3", "rounded|Sounds perfect. Could I see it this weekend?": "3f3f89141fab.mp3", "airy|Sure. How about Saturday at eleven?": "4be6faded9ed.mp3", "airy|Kevin, the client wants the brochures by Wednesday instead of Friday.": "9a01668a4008.mp3", "rounded|That's tight. The printing company needs at least three days.": "6890c2bbad16.mp3", "airy|Could we pay extra for express service?": "7c08f2f5412e.mp3", "rounded|Let me call them and check the price.": "b299fc2083f8.mp3", "rounded|I'd like to send this package to Toronto. How long will it take?": "b12e04df96e5.mp3", "airy|Standard delivery takes seven days. Express takes two, but it costs twenty dollars more.": "e7c26a29ba90.mp3", "rounded|I'll take express. It's a birthday gift, and it needs to arrive by Friday.": "1c643dcd64c2.mp3", "airy|All right. Please write the address on this label.": "8476257ad3a4.mp3", "airy|The new accounting software is confusing. I can't figure out how to create an invoice.": "89e4db08ffaf.mp3", "rounded|There's a training session tomorrow at two in the computer lab.": "f537320d7638.mp3", "airy|Oh, good. Do I need to sign up?": "b370db2273f6.mp3", "rounded|Yes, just send an e-mail to the IT department.": "8fd8151cc499.mp3", "rounded|Welcome to Sunrise Hotel. How may I help you?": "3b0d5b62071f.mp3", "airy|I have a reservation under the name Garcia, for three nights.": "29c939328e95.mp3", "rounded|Yes, Ms. Garcia. Your room is ready. Breakfast is served from six to ten on the second floor.": "c7c72d16cc4e.mp3", "airy|Thank you. Could I also get a wake-up call at six thirty?": "338630741f6d.mp3", "airy|Our team exceeded the sales target by fifteen percent this quarter.": "9ab05638bd9f.mp3", "rounded|That's great news. We should celebrate. How about a team lunch on Friday?": "6682f504affe.mp3", "airy|Good idea. I'll reserve the Italian place across the street.": "ddcf6635c5ad.mp3", "rounded|Perfect. I'll send an invitation to everyone this afternoon.": "c13be188d1fc.mp3", "rounded|Excuse me, does this train stop at Central Station?": "d1da4fb0d3da.mp3", "airy|No, this is the express. You need the local train on platform four.": "032cd39bad93.mp3", "rounded|Oh, thanks. When does it leave?": "7bbbeb7a99c2.mp3", "airy|In about five minutes, so you'd better hurry.": "9ad7257a2c09.mp3", "buttery|Attention, passengers. Flight 372 to Osaka has been delayed due to bad weather.": "e2c9d115512a.mp3", "buttery|The new departure time is 4:45 P.M. Passengers are asked to remain near gate 12.": "9a9ab3386053.mp3", "buttery|Meal vouchers are available at the service counter next to the gate.": "a5f1ce84e02d.mp3", "buttery|We apologize for the inconvenience.": "cdd297d8e234.mp3", "buttery|Hello, this is Sarah from Bright Dental Clinic calling for Mr. Howard.": "1cf51f9c7c38.mp3", "buttery|I'm calling to remind you of your appointment tomorrow at 2 P.M. Please arrive ten minutes early to update your insurance information.": "e35b28eef45c.mp3", "buttery|If you need to reschedule, call us at 555-0178 before 5 P.M. today.": "e8ab40aadcf4.mp3", "buttery|Thank you.": "2fb35a443a4e.mp3", "buttery|Attention, shoppers. Welcome to Greenfield Supermarket. Today only, all fresh fruit and vegetables are twenty percent off.": "134073145ea1.mp3", "buttery|Also, don't forget to visit our new bakery section near the entrance, where you can try free samples of our bread.": "518de60959a7.mp3", "buttery|The store will close at 10 P.M. tonight. Thank you for shopping with us.": "cbbacdd4a876.mp3", "buttery|Good morning. This is the seven o'clock weather report. Heavy rain is expected throughout the afternoon, with strong winds in coastal areas.": "0f31f147ba78.mp3", "buttery|Drivers should allow extra time for the evening commute. The rain will clear by tomorrow morning, and the weekend looks sunny and warm.": "bfea1525352d.mp3", "buttery|Stay tuned for the traffic update, coming up next.": "5deddf51818f.mp3", "buttery|Welcome to the Harborview Museum. My name is Linda, and I'll be your guide today.": "8a2927910b7d.mp3", "buttery|The tour will last about one hour. We'll start in the modern art gallery and finish in the sculpture garden.": "4c037f2f57c3.mp3", "buttery|Please remember that photography is not allowed inside the galleries.": "feabe576394e.mp3", "buttery|After the tour, you're welcome to visit the gift shop on the first floor.": "47dd83db9a68.mp3", "buttery|Thanks for coming, everyone. Before we begin, I have an announcement.": "876a49abc89c.mp3", "buttery|Starting next Monday, the office will switch to a new security system.": "2edc992a886e.mp3", "buttery|Each employee will receive a new I.D. card, which you'll need to enter the building.": "8ee9489dd97f.mp3", "buttery|Please pick up your card from the security desk by Friday. If you lose it, there will be a ten-dollar replacement fee.": "651b9330cef6.mp3", "buttery|Are you looking for a place to stay fit? Join Peak Fitness Center this month and get your first month free.": "beced52912ed.mp3", "buttery|We offer modern equipment, yoga classes, and personal trainers.": "9e8d03ff86ef.mp3", "buttery|We're open twenty-four hours a day, seven days a week. Visit our website or stop by our location on Lake Street to sign up today.": "c2e7586eb171.mp3", "buttery|Thank you for calling City Electric. Our offices are currently closed.": "25361952f32b.mp3", "buttery|Our business hours are Monday through Friday, 8 A.M. to 6 P.M. To report a power outage, press one.": "c0469ef13af8.mp3", "buttery|To hear your account balance, press two. For all other questions, please call back during business hours.": "a0088fb42867.mp3", "buttery|Attention, passengers on the 9:15 train to Riverside. Due to track maintenance, this train will depart from platform six instead of platform two.": "f3050dee14d5.mp3", "buttery|The departure time has not changed. Passengers with large luggage should use the elevator at the north end of the station.": "9a89d85e015f.mp3", "buttery|We thank you for your patience.": "50dc1fbc1599.mp3", "buttery|Good evening, and welcome to the annual employee awards dinner.": "d96174706c14.mp3", "buttery|Tonight, we're honoring Maria Santos, who has worked in our customer service department for twenty years.": "44d0287aeaed.mp3", "buttery|Maria has trained more than one hundred new employees and has always been a role model for her team.": "029bad4f28b7.mp3", "buttery|Please join me in welcoming Maria to the stage.": "148f7ded8e67.mp3"}